OL,3,GNEWSA'I want justice after boy's evil
OL,4,Aknife attack on my daughter'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a 14-year-old girl who
OL,7,Fwas repeatedly stabbed in an "evil"
OL,8,Fattack by a boy says it is
OL,9,F"disgraceful" that he was not jailed.
OL,11,FThe boy, 14, from Wiltshire, had
OL,12,Fstalked the girl after she refused to
OL,13,Fdate him before attacking her with a
OL,14,F6in knife in broad daylight at a shop
OL,15,Fin Cirencester, Gloucestershire, on 15
OL,16,FMarch.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
