OL,3,GNEWSA'I want justice after boy's evil
OL,4,Aknife attack on my daughter'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast month, he was sentenced to a
OL,7,Fthree-year restraining order and a
OL,8,Fone-year referral order after he
OL,9,Fadmitted wounding with intent,
OL,10,Finflicting grievous bodily harm and
OL,11,Fpossession of a bladed article in a
OL,12,Fpublic place.
OL,14,FThe girl's mother said: "If it hadn't
OL,15,Fbeen for the shopkeeper and her [own]
OL,16,Fquick reactions, she would have been
OL,17,Fdead."
